{
  "id": "5a632415-190a-449d-8c2f-ccf5f972a79f",
  "title": "Unified 3D Generation and Understanding Frameworks",
  "summary": "DreamOmni3 enables flexible 3D editing and generation using scribble-based tasks, while TASE improves 3D scene understanding and editing through truncation-aware embeddings, and Hunyuan3D-Buffalo 1.0 offers a scalable solution combining multimodal models for 3D understanding, generation, and editing. Know3D proposes a novel framework that integrates rich knowledge from multimodal large language models into 3D generative processes, enabling language-controllable generation of back-view for 3D assets. LaviGen repurposes 3D generative models for autoregressive layout generation, directly modeling geometric relations and physical constraints in 3D space.",
